00:35:47.000 --> 00:36:17.000
and if they respond badly, it's going to ruin everything. And so what Alexander Ford finds is that if you can figure out why you're putting it off, you can focus on the other thing instead. So if you don't want to do your taxes because I don't want to go and find all the little forms and do all the little numbers and like, where is my W2? Oh, I moved institutions. I need to find my lat, you know, all these little, like the nitty-gritty details. By shifting my focus to why I'm doing it, the bigger overarching abstract.

